== Commission ==
The [[Commissions#Commission Pool 2 .28.26 4.29|2x Mithril Powder Collection]] [[Commissions|Commission]] requires the player to collect {{Mithril Powder|500}}, during the 2x Powder event. If the player receives the commission ''after'' collecting {{Mithril Powder|500}}, the Commission will be immediately completed, as long as the event is still running.

