'''Abiphone Contacts Trio''' is a {{Special}} item obtained from the [[Bits Shop]]. It grants an extra {{Aqua|+3}} contact slots to the [[player]]'s [[Abiphone]] plan.

== Obtaining ==
'''Abiphone Contacts Trio''' can be obtained from the [[Bits Shop]] for {{Bits|6450}}.

== Usage ==
'''Abiphone Contacts Trio''' grants an extra {{Aqua|+3}} contact slots for the [[player]]'s [[Abiphone]]. This bonus stays even if the [[Abiphone]] model is upgraded, and the bonus ignores the [[Abiphone]]'s contact limit.<br>Abiphone Contacts Trio can be used up to 25 times, which grants an additional {{Aqua|+75}} contact slots.

The '''Abiphone Contacts Trio''' can also be used to obtain [[Elizabeth]]'s [[Abiphones#Contacts|Abiphone Contact]].

