=== Usage ===
The '''{{Green|Contact Directory}}''' can be sorted into different categories, to ease navigation:
*All
*Missing
*Completed Quest but not Active
*A-Z
*Z-A

On top of categorisation, the '''{{Green|Contact Directory}}''' a quick overview of the NPC, shows where they are usually located, the requirement to obtain their contact, and text displaying the difficulty for obtaining it. The difficulties that can be seen are:
*{{Green|Easy}}
*{{Yellow|Medium}}
