The '''Abyssal Miner''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Mithril Deposits}}, {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}}, or {{Zone|Jungle}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Abyssal Miner''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Mithril Deposits}}, {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}}, or {{Zone|Jungle}}. It requires {{Skill|Fishing|24}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Abyssal Miner''' is {{Green|90}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|2.05%|1|48.73|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
