'''Adventurer Saul''' is an [[NPC]] in {{zone|Dungeon Hub}} that allows players to queue into dungeons alone, after they have beaten [[The Professor]], by giving them {{Item|Saul's Recommendation}}.

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|-
|First interaction
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: I've been thinking recently...
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Have you noticed that it's not possible to enter &cThe Catacombs&f alone?
&eSelect an option:&a [Yeah. Why is that?]}}
|-
|After selecting {{Rmt|&a[Yeah. Why is that?]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Mort's just really stubborn when it comes to &cThe Catacombs&f. He's seen so many adventurers get lost down there that he now refuses to let anyone in without a buddy.
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Not the mention that &cThe Catacombs&f is &4extremenly dangerous&f to explore alone.
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Although he won't let the average adventurer pass, he might reconsider it if you're strong enough.
&eSelect an option:&a [How do I prove that I'm strong enough?]}}
|-
|After selecting {{Rmt|&a[How do I prove that I'm strong enough?]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Well, for &cThe Catacombs&f, I reckon that if you have defeated &dThe Professor&f, he'd probably let you in.
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: If you can do that, I'll give you my personal &6recommendation&f!
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Talk to me again when you have done that.}}
|-
|Without having beaten [[The Professor]]
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Unfortunately, it seems you haven't yet defeated &dThe Professor&f! Come back when you have done that!}}
|-
|Having beaten [[The Professor]]
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: So, have you defeated &dThe Professor&f yet?
&eSelect an option:&a [Uh, yeah. I'm the best.]}}
|-
|After selecting {{Rmt|&a[Uh, yeah. I'm the best.]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Then take this letter to Mort whenever you feel like entering &cThe Catacombs&f alone. Make sure that you're not in a party.
&e[NPC] &dAdventurer Saul&f: Best of luck.
&aYou claimed a &6Saul's Recommendation&a!}}
|-
|After claiming [[Saul's Recommendation]]
|{{Dialogue|
