The '''Better Together''' is a passive event that can happen in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}. 

== Mechanics ==
The '''Better Together''' event lasts for {{Green|20}} minutes. For every player in the same zone, players gain {{stat|mining speed|250}} and {{stat|mining fortune|20}}. The buff maxes out at {{Green|5}} players.

